{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reconcile","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"with","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"remote","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV","text":"EntityStore","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deleting","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deletedIDs","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preserving","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">)","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rows read from storage for the IDs in question. Rows for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"IDs the caller didn’t ask about are simply not here, and their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"absence means nothing."}]}],"name":"remote"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IDs storage reports as deleted elsewhere. Removed with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same origin a full reconcile uses, so no deletion is recorded and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"none is echoed back to the store it came from. An ID that "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"remote"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still holds is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"type":"text","text":" removed however it is named here: a live row"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is positive evidence, and a tombstone can be stale."}]}],"name":"deletedIDs"},{"name":"preserving","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IDs the caller knows carry unflushed local intent, exactly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as in the full reconcile. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"remote"},{"type":"text","text":" has no authority over them, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"neither does "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deletedIDs"},{"type":"text","text":". This store’s own un-drained "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/changes","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"folded in automatically."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The counterpart to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)"},{"type":"text","text":" for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"partial read — a refresh of the rows a sync tick reported as changed,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than of the whole table. Absorbing rows works identically; what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes is where deletions come from."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A partial snapshot ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"cannot"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" infer deletion from absence. An ID missing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from it was not deleted, it was not asked for, and treating the two alike","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"would empty the store on the first partial merge. So removal is driven","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entirely by ","type":"text"},{"code":"deletedIDs","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which the caller must have positive evidence","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for — a history tombstone, not an empty result.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Does "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"type":"text","text":" record changes — this is a hydration operation, for the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reason the full reconcile isn’t one."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"]]},"metadata":{"title":"reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reconcile"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV","text":"EntityStore"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"deleting"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preserving"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"externalID":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV9reconcile4with8deleting10preservingyACyxG_Shy10Foundation4UUIDVGALtF","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Reconciles this store against a snapshot covering only ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"some"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" of its IDs.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Reconciles this store against an authoritative snapshot from storage.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)","title":"reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reconcile","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"with","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntityStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preserving","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"removingMissing","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"type